al-fantasy\" class=\"entity-link\">Final Fantasy</a> VII.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Part Of:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/final-fantasy\" class=\"entity-link\">Final Fantasy</a>\n            — <a href=\"/final-fantasy\" class=\"entity-link\">Final Fantasy</a> VII is a mainline entry.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Involves:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/final-fantasy/final-fantasy-vii/sephiroth\" class=\"entity-link\">Sephiroth</a>\n            — <a href=\"/final-fantasy/final-fantasy-vii/sephiroth\" class=\"entity-link\">Sephiroth</a> is the primary antagonist of VII.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Contains:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/final-fantasy/final-fantasy-vii/midgar\" class=\"entity-link\">Midgar</a>\n            — <a href=\"/final-fantasy/final-fantasy-vii/midgar\" class=\"entity-link\">Midgar</a> is the opening setting of VII.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Involves:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/final-fantasy/final-fantasy-vii/aerith-gainsborough\" class=\"entity-link\">Aerith Gainsborough</a>\n            — Aerith is central to <a href=\"/final-fantasy\" class=\"entity-link\">Final Fantasy</a> VII.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Involves:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/final-fantasy/final-fantasy-vii/tifa-lockhart\" class=\"entity-link\">Tifa Lockhart</a>\n            — Tifa is a main party member in VII.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Contains:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/final-fantasy/final-fantasy-vii/lifestream\" class=\"entity-link\">Lifestream</a>\n            — The <a href=\"/final-fantasy/final-fantasy-vii/lifestream\" class=\"entity-link\">Lifestream</a> defines VII&#039;s cosmology.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/final-fantasy/nobuo-uematsu\" class=\"entity-link\">Nobuo Uematsu</a>\n            — <a href=\"/final-fantasy/nobuo-uematsu\" cla